  "title": "Scheduled workouts calendar (get_scheduled_workouts)",
  "description": "Returned by garminconnect's get_scheduled_workouts(year, month). Consumed by sync_scheduled_workouts, which includes a calendarItem as a real scheduled workout if either (a) workoutId is non-null (workout created via create_workout/the Garmin workout builder), or (b) itemType==fbtAdaptiveWorkout with a non-null trainingPlanId (coach/training-plan-assigned workout \u2014 confirmed live 2026-08-02 against an active coach plan, trainingPlanId 46457367). Still no positive fixture for case (a); case (b) is real and verified. No positive fixture yet for a real scheduled/uploaded (case a) workout item (see README gaps).\n\nVerified against: 2026-07 (30 items, 0 with workoutId), 2026-08 (9 items, 0 with workoutId, 6 with itemType==fbtAdaptiveWorkout \u2014 the coach-plan items case (b) exists to catch). Additional fields beyond what's listed here may exist and are tolerated (additionalProperties: true) \u2014 Garmin adding new fields is not a breaking change; a listed field disappearing or changing type is."
